          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yisho enkosini nasendlovukazini ukuthi: ‘Zithobeni, nihlale phansi, ngokuba ababusi benu bayakwehla, umqhele wodumo lwenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.18",
