          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi uma uthi enhliziyweni yakho: Kungani lezi zinto zingehlela na? Ngokuba ubukhulu bobubi bakho izambatho zakho zambuliwe, nezithende zakho zambulwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.22",
