          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lokhu kuyinkatho yenu, isabelo senu esilinganiselwe esivela kimi, usho uJehova; ngoba ningikhohliwe Mina, lethemba amanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
